Building the project around a fictional company:
-------------------------------------------------

Company: KAVI CORPORATION

Departments:
- IT
- HR
- Finance
- Sales
- Marketing

Roles:
- Employee
- IT Support
- HR Analyst
- Finance Analyst
- IT Administrator



Employer joins Sopanam Corporation:
-----------------------------------

Employee joins KAVI CORPORATION
        │
        ▼
   HR System
        │
        ▼
     midPoint
        │
        ├── Create identity
        │
        ├── Assign employee role
        │
        ├── Assign department role
        │
        ├── Calculate required access
        │
        ▼
Provision accounts
        │
        ├── Active Directory
        ├── LDAP
        └── Applications


Following is JML process followed:
---------------------------------

JOINER
------
HR creates employee
      ↓
midPoint
      ↓
Identity created
      ↓
Roles assigned
      ↓
Accounts provisioned


MOVER
-----
Employee changes department
      ↓
midPoint detects change
      ↓
Old role removed
      ↓
New role assigned
      ↓
Access recalculated
      ↓
Target systems updated


LEAVER
------
Employee leaves company
      ↓
HR updates status
      ↓
midPoint detects departure
      ↓
Roles removed
      ↓
Accounts disabled
      ↓
Application access removed


